    "date": 1693828990,
    "caption": "🦾 From August 28th to 30th, in Astana, @indrive.kz in collaboration with @astana.hub, organized an IT career orientation festival for rural school students.\n⠀\n🤩The event was attended by 40 tenth-graders and 15 computer science teachers from 11 regions of Kazakhstan. These are the top participants of the @beginit_org social and educational project by the inDrive company for the 2022-2023 academic year.\n⠀\nThe project in Kazakhstan is being implemented in partnership with the @iqanat.kz and the @umckrg.\n⠀\n🚀BeginIT Summer Fest is a career orientation platform, the very «gateway» to the IT industry. Over the course of three days, 33 expert speakers representing the Astana HUB community addressed the students.\n⠀\n🫶🏻We thank all the speakers and startups who supported the project!\n⠀\nBaglan Kuturbaev\nAlikhan Talipov\nVitaliy Perov, TSARKA\nMadi Khanafiya, Astana HUB\nDiana Abzalidenova, Astana HUB\n@weloveflutterflow \n@usabilitylab.global \n@omnium_kz \n@animo_kz \n@cybionyx.inc \n@getkscooter \nVasiliy Kuzmin, inDrive\n⠀\n🩵We hope that in the future there will be more such festivals!",
